      "content": "Your symptoms could indeed be related to stress and disrupted sleep patterns, which can impair cognitive function and cause feelings of brain fog. This type of temporary confusion is often referred to as a \"foggy spell\" or \"thought interruption.\" However, it's also possible that there may be an underlying neurological issue, so it's a good idea to consult a doctor or a neurologist to rule out any potential underlying conditions.",
