      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i just feel like i'm overreacting and it's probably just my brain being tired. like, if i just take some melatonin pretty heavily for a week to catch up on sleep, do you think that would pretty much fix the word-finding thing? i really just want to sleep it off and see if it goes away by itself before i go making a big deal out of it at a doctor's office.",
